      "The 17-24 age band rests on only 92 sampled households — treat it as indicative. Cells suppressed by Statistics Finland (shown as '..' in the source) are counted as 0.",
      "The hackathon transaction dataset is synthetic; its levels (e.g. restaurants) are higher than the national averages. Benchmarks are a reality check for the coach, not a judgement."
